  "note": "16b Hodge Kaleidoscope round 2 (#84 comment 6481396559, the user's grade: change shapes faster, speed on the controller). shapeRate holds 8/4/2/1/½ bars (default 2), morph min(1 bar, hold/2) from the beat with a +6 % pop, trigger() on the next beat, auto walks a 15-step dimension-alternating cycle. Truths 1-5 as round 1; 6, 8, 9, 10 on the scheduler at every step (frame-exact simulation of the page's own code) plus the live log; 7 morph sync; 11 truths 1-5 on every settled preset; 12 flash via the shared gates.",
